### 📄 01_create_students_table.sql

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (
    id INT,
    name VARCHAR(100),
    branch VARCHAR(50),
    age INT
);
```

### 📄 02_create_courses_table.sql

```sql
CREATE TABLE courses (
    course_id INT,
    course_name VARCHAR(100),
    duration INT,
    description TEXT
);
```

### 📄 03_table_with_primary_key.sql

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (
    id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(100),
    branch VARCHAR(50)
);
```

### 📄 04_table_with_constraints.sql

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (
    id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE,
    age INT CHECK (age >= 18)
);

